sequenceDiagram
    participant Git as GitHub/GitLab
    participant Conn as Connector Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Rules as Drift Engine
    participant UI as Architect UI
    Git->>Conn: Signed push/MR webhook
    Conn->>Conn: Validate signature, dedupe, fetch bounded metadata
    Conn->>DB: Store immutable raw snapshot + canonical observations
    DB-->>Rules: Outbox: source.updated
    Rules->>DB: Read desired, static, runtime and source freshness
    Rules->>DB: Record deterministic drift finding with evidence
    Rules-->>UI: Authorized project event / notification
    UI->>Rules: Inspect finding & evidence

    Note over UI,Rules: Cross-platform design sequence
    participant Policy as Cerbos
    participant Ret as Scoped Retriever
    participant LLM as LiteLLM
    participant Trace as Langfuse
    UI->>Policy: Can compare Projects A and B?
    Policy-->>UI: Per-project + federation decisions
    UI->>Ret: Question + authorized graph scope
    Ret->>Ret: Fetch contracts/topology/ADRs/trust zones and uncertainties
    Ret->>LLM: Minimal redacted evidence + prompt through scoped gateway key
    LLM-->>Ret: Two+ candidate designs, risks and source refs
    LLM-->>Trace: Correlated latency, model, cost and sanitized spans
    Ret->>Ret: Validate citations and bounded claims
    Ret-->>UI: Alternatives + diagrams/ADR/task drafts (not applied)
